// An event of kind rbi_kind for the ribbon's combo boxes. The combo box that has the keyboard takes every event, and a press that is not on it is its end: it commits what was typed and the press is owed to what is under. A press on a combo box that has not the keyboard gives it the keyboard and goes to it, unless a menu, a gallery or a colour grid is open, which has the press. Answers bits like rib_event: 1 paint again, 2 a command was given (rbe_cb_emit), 4 the press is owed to what is under, 8 the combo box took the event; 0 when it is none of its business.
